# Rust & Cargo
/program/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# program/Cargo.lock is deliberately COMMITTED: the runbook's ProgramData hash
# verification is only reproducible with a pinned dependency graph.

# Android Build Outputs & Gradle
/mobile/android/app/build/
/mobile/android/.gradle/
/mobile/android/build/
/mobile/.expo/

# Generated by Gradle via Expo `export:embed` during assembleRelease. This is a
# BUILD ARTIFACT, not source, and a tracked bundle is precisely how a live RPC key
# was published to every app user and into git history. Gradle regenerates it, so
# keeping it out of the repo costs nothing. (It is also why metro.config.js now
# fails the BUNDLE when an EXPO_PUBLIC_* value looks keyed.)
/mobile/android/app/src/main/assets/index.android.bundle
*.apk
*.aab
.gradle/
build/

