.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-*

# Claude Code tooling — local only, never published.
#
# These were tracked and showed up on the public repo page. They are editor/
# tooling config, not project source, so they stay on disk (so local tooling
# keeps working) but out of the repo. Unanchored so they match at any depth:
# `mobile/CLAUDE.md` and `mobile/.claude/` are covered too.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

